<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Week 3 睡眠作息</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #000000;
        }
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .watermark {
            position: absolute;
            top: 52%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            font-size: 140px;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
            z-index: 0;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 0.9;
            pointer-events: none;
            user-select: none;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border: 2px solid #F3C43B;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            background-color: transparent;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 2px solid #F3C43B;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .col-title {
            background-color: #FDE68A;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            width: 120px;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        .title-week {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 22px;
        }
        .title-goal {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .border-dashed-bottom {
            border-bottom: 2px dashed #F3C43B !important;
        }
        .sub-label {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-align: center;
            vertical-align: middle;
            width: 130px;
            border-right: none !important;
        }
        .sub-content {
            border-left: none !important;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        .sub-content p {
            margin: 6px 0;
        }
        .text-center {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .notes-content p {
            margin: 8px 0;
        }
        u {
            text-decoration: underline;
            text-underline-offset: 3px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="watermark">MOM<br>POWER</div>
        <table>
            <tr>
                <td class="col-title">周龄</td>
                <td colspan="2" class="title-week">Week 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="col-title">新目标</td>
                <td colspan="2" class="title-goal">帮宝宝分辨昼夜</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td rowspan="3" class="col-title">怎么做</td>
                <td class="sub-label border-dashed-bottom">在白天：</td>
                <td class="sub-content border-dashed-bottom">
                    <p>① 当宝宝醒着的时候，开灯、开窗，保持光线明亮</p>
                    <p>② 宝宝吃奶后，保持TA清醒一会儿，做一些亲子活动比如唱歌说话、俯卧训练</p>
                    <p>③ 喂食间隔不要超过3个小时。如果有必要，叫醒他</p>
                    <p>④ 白天一次清醒时长30-60分钟，包括喂奶时间在内</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="sub-label border-dashed-bottom">在晚上：</td>
                <td class="sub-content border-dashed-bottom">
                    <p>① 继续停顿，如果在停顿之后，确定宝宝需要喂奶或换尿布，不要和TA玩，也不要和TA说太多话</p>
                    <p>② 晚上喂奶前换好尿布，可以用吸水量大一些的夜用尿不湿</p>
                    <p>③ 尽可能把宝宝裹起来（襁褓及睡袋介绍见之前笔记）</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="sub-label">昼夜模式区分<br>清晰</td>
                <td class="sub-content">
                    <p>总之，充分区分白天和黑夜的环境和活动模式的不同，尽可能把长时间的睡眠留到晚上。</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="col-title">注意事项</td>
                <td colspan="2" class="text-center notes-content">
                    <p>1.在这个周龄，不要太担心养成不好的睡觉习惯。宝宝在你怀里或身上小睡一会儿是完全没问题的。不用强调作息时间，跟着宝宝的自然节奏就行了。</p>
                    <p>3.夜晚不走吃、玩、睡的周期，除了换尿布和喂奶之外，不需要清醒时间</p>
                    <p>4.只要宝宝健康，体重正常增长，不需要<u>在晚上</u>叫醒宝宝喂奶。尽可能让他自己醒来</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
